&lt;h2 id="orgef18076"&gt;&lt;span class="section-number-2"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; apathy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="outline-text-2" id="text-1"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
[ &lt;i&gt;ˈapəthē&lt;/i&gt; ]&lt;br&gt;
(n.) lack of feeling or emotion, lack of interest or concern.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
Drug abuse leading to apathy and depression.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;


