&lt;div class="outline-text-2" id="text-1"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
[ &lt;i&gt;miˈthäləjē&lt;/i&gt; ]&lt;br&gt;
(n.) the body of customs, beliefs, stories, and sayings associated with a people, thing, or place&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
Ares is the god of war in Greek mythology.&lt;br&gt;
